Subject: Service optional native hardware from genuine SDK owner boundaries
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Register a bounded host hardware endpoint underneath original source execution.
Clock, window owner and GX owner waits service latched native input without
changing clock arithmetic, source tasks or game decisions. The endpoint retains
foreign/masked/reentrant input and explicitly retires its borrowed callbacks.
No event, controller readiness, retrace timing or game shutdown is invented.

